{"t": 1794124915.53304, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "Checkout AG-7731: OnCall reports 38% gateway 4xx. Loki entries (2026-11-05 07:41 UTC) show API 2026-11 switched to strict amounts and rejected amount=12.34: amount must be integer minor units (cents). checkout/gateway.py was sending euros directly; patched the local file to send int(round(amount_eur * 100)), retaining EUR. Verified the logged case (12.34 -> 1234), float-truncation case (0.29 -> 29), and all 100,001 cent-denominated inputs EUR 0\u20131000. pytest found no tests. Not deployed; production recovery is not verified. Responders should review/deploy the patch and confirm gateway 4xx recovery."}, "ok": true}
